#~ msgid ""
#~ "The client provides the following "
#~ "thread-safe methods for initiating "
#~ "transfers:"
#~ msgstr "用戶端提供以下線程安全方法來啟動傳輸："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Each of these methods creates a "
#~ "new daemon thread that executes the "
#~ "actual worker function (the non-``_thread``"
#~ " version). This prevents the console "
#~ "thread from being blocked."
#~ msgstr "這些方法中的每一個都會建立一個新的守護線程來執行實際的工作函數（非“_thread”版本）。這可以防止控制台線程被阻塞。"

#~ msgid "``/file <file_path> <client_id> [destination_file_path]``"
