#~ msgid "``/file_folder <folder_path> <client_id> [destination_file_path]``"
#~ msgstr "``/file_folder <相對路徑> <檔名>``"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "For the multiple-item commands the "
#~ "destination is the last argument; when"
#~ " the last argument is an existing "
#~ "local file/folder it is treated as "
#~ "another item to transfer instead."
#~ msgstr "對於多項目命令，目標是最後一個參數；當最後一個參數是現有的本機檔案/資料夾時，它將被視為另一個要傳輸的項目。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Sends multiple files to multiple "
#~ "clients. The message format is "
#~ "``/multiple_file_multiple_client <file1> <file2> ..."
#~ " <client_addr1> <client_addr2> ...``. Files "
#~ "must appear before clients."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "將多個文件傳送給多個客戶端。訊息格式為``/multiple_file_multiple_client <file1> "
#~ "<file2> ... <client_addr1> <client_addr2> "
#~ "...``。文件必須出現在客戶面前。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Sends different file lists to different"
#~ " clients. The message alternates between"
#~ " groups: a list of files, then "
#~ "a list of client addresses, then "
#~ "the next list of files, etc. "
#~ "Example: ``/diff_multiple_file_diff_multiple_client a.txt"
#~ " b.txt (ip1,port1) (ip2,port2) c.txt "
#~ "(ip3,port3)``"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "向不同的客戶端發送不同的文件清單。訊息在群組之間交替：文件列表，然後是客戶端位址列表，然後是下一個文件列表，等等。範例：``/diff_multiple_file_diff_multiple_client"
#~ " a.txt b.txt (ip1,port1) (ip2,port2) c.txt"
#~ " (ip3,port3)``"

